  "story": "Drummers stand in a line across a valley and pass a message by drumming. Drummer i can be heard by the next reach[i] drummers down the line and may hand the message to any one of them; a drummer with reach 0 can hand it to nobody. The first drummer starts with the message. What is the fewest hand-overs that bring it to the last drummer? If it cannot arrive, report -1. A long line must be checked within the operation budget.",
