  "performance": {"required": true, "baselineFactor": 10},
  "hints": ["Do not decide who receives the message. Ask instead: after one hand-over, how far down the line can the message be? After two?", "Walk the line once and keep two positions: the end of the stretch the current number of hand-overs can reach, and the farthest place one more hand-over could reach, which is the MAX of position PLUS reach over the drummers passed so far.", "When your position is EQUAL to the end of the stretch, one more hand-over is needed: IF the farthest place is no further than your position RETURN -1, otherwise add 1 to the count and SET the end to the farthest place. RETURN the count as soon as the end covers the last drummer."],
